motion-presenter
================

A fork of motion-designer by kaventro, https://github.com/kaventro/motion-designer,
at upstream commit 7d0b8bb ("Add motion blur, a phone-size review and scored
reviews (#8)"). MIT licence, see LICENSE; every addition is released under the
same licence.

Contributors
------------

- kaventro: motion-designer (upstream).
- Alejandro Roman: the engine additions in skills/motion-designer and the
  skills/motion-presenter series layer, released under MIT.
- Kevin Veen-Birkenbach: the security fixes and the adaptation (neutral theme,
  scene data input, packaging).

