skills/motion-presenter/defaults/voice/narrator.wav
  "Bella", a synthetic voice generated locally with Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0),
  voice af_bella, 2026-10-07. No person's voice and no third-party service
  terms are involved; the consent terms and the spoken text are in
  skills/motion-presenter/defaults/voice/CONSENT.md. Speech made from it with
  Chatterbox carries Resemble AI's inaudible watermark.

skills/motion-presenter/defaults/theme/logo.svg
